00:00:45.852 --> 00:00:47.519
- Pain is temporary.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.621
It may last for a minute, or an hour,

00:00:52.621 --> 00:00:54.704
or a day, or even a year.

00:00:56.353 --> 00:00:58.936
But eventually it will subside.

00:00:59.892 --> 00:01:03.057
And something else will take its place.

00:01:03.057 --> 00:01:05.440
If I quit, however, it will last forever.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:09.203
Listen to me, I'm telling
you all as I leave.

00:01:09.203 --> 00:01:10.354
I'm telling you as I leave,

00:01:10.354 --> 00:01:12.227
I was homeless for two and a half years.

00:01:12.227 --> 00:01:13.306
And the problem with most of you,

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:14.548
