00:01:22.752 --> 00:01:23.783
We going to keep it real tonight.

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:25.930
Some of you are spoiled brats.

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:27.530
Every time you ever got in trouble

00:01:27.530 --> 00:01:31.210
