00:01:55.179 --> 00:01:57.144
Somebody say, if I don't
go home I feel bad.

00:01:57.144 --> 00:01:58.311
Go through it.

00:01:59.447 --> 00:02:01.281
You ain't going to die.

00:02:01.281 --> 00:02:03.944
At the end of pain is success.

00:02:03.944 --> 00:02:08.446
You're not going to die cause
you're feelin' a little pain.

00:02:08.446 --> 00:02:10.166
I'm not eating like I eat at home.

00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:11.615
