00:02:15.747 --> 00:02:18.497
It's time to become a man, woman.

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:22.937
So don't worry about a little pain.

00:02:23.794 --> 00:02:24.869
- Pain...

00:02:24.869 --> 00:02:25.952
Is necessary.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:29.888
It's inescapable.

00:02:29.888 --> 00:02:31.668
There's no way,

00:02:31.668 --> 00:02:34.335
I mean out of pain, we are born.

00:02:36.038 --> 00:02:37.288
Pain is a must.

00:02:38.527 --> 00:02:41.027
Pain is a necessity of growth.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:45.063
Be comfortable with being uncomfortable.

00:02:45.063 --> 00:02:47.613
Pain is a necessary evil.

00:02:47.613 --> 00:02:48.806
Get used to it.

00:02:48.806 --> 00:02:51.294
Make friends with it,

00:02:51.294 --> 00:02:55.033
