Any single person who has
ever done anything worthwhile

00:03:29.324 --> 00:03:33.074
or exceptional or
difficult or extraordinary,

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:37.746
anyone, whether it's
great artists or authors

00:03:37.746 --> 00:03:41.207
or mathematicians or
whatever the (bleep) it is.

00:03:41.207 --> 00:03:44.735
Everyone encounters difficulties.

00:03:44.735 --> 00:03:46.710
There is no easy road.

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:49.506
It does not exist, it is impossible.

00:03:49.506 --> 00:03:51.465
Everyone has issues.

00:03:51.465 --> 00:03:53.757
If you have time to pursue a hobby,

00:03:53.757 --> 00:03:55.762
if you have time to do
anything in your life,

00:03:55.762 --> 00:03:58.502
